---
// Not-found page. Astro emits this as dist/404.html, which Cloudflare Pages
// serves with a real 404 status for any unknown path. Its presence is
// load-bearing beyond courtesy: WITHOUT a 404.html, Cloudflare Pages falls
// back to single-page-app mode and answers every unknown path — including
// /_astro/* asset URLs from another deploy during the window around a
// release — with the homepage as 200 text/html. Stored under an asset URL,
// that response breaks pages with MIME refusals (the 2026-07-16 update
// flash). A real 404 status means no cache layer will ever keep it.
//
// DELIBERATELY STANDALONE, like /offline/: no BaseLayout, no hashed /_astro/
// dependencies, so this page renders whole no matter which build's assets a
// device holds. Colors mirror base.css tokens.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Page not found | Resilience Hub Toolkit</title>
    <meta name="description" content="There is no page at this address." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <!-- is:inline keeps the styles in this HTML instead of a hashed /_astro/
         asset — this page must not depend on any build's asset set. -->
    <style is:inline>
      :root {
        --background: oklch(0.9911 0 0);
        --foreground: oklch(0.2046 0 0);
        --muted-foreground: oklch(0.2435 0 0);
        --primary: oklch(0.5756 0.1368 42.8);
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --background: oklch(0.1822 0 0);
          --foreground: oklch(0.9288 0.0126 255.5078);
          --muted-foreground: oklch(0.82 0.01 255.5);
          --primary: oklch(0.75 0.15 42.8);
        }
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--background);
        color: var(--foreground);
        font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      main {
        max-width: 42rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 3rem 1rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
      }
      p {
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      }
      ul {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 2rem 0 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      li {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
      }
      a {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 500;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>There is no page at this address</h1>
      <p>The address may have changed or been mistyped.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Go to the home page</a></li>
        <li><a href="/modules">Browse the toolkit modules</a></li>
      </ul>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
